<section class="experience" id="experience"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / The journey</span><h2>Experience that connects.</h2></div><p>Bringing business needs, technical teams, and better healthcare outcomes together.</p></div>
<article class="role"><div class="role-meta"><time>Oct 2024 — Present</time><span class="current"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Current role</span></div><div><h3>Wellmark BlueCross BlueShield</h3><p class="role-title">Business System Analyst</p><p class="role-description">Shaping healthcare interoperability through product roadmaps, FHIR APIs, and requirements that connect providers, payers, and partners.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Product ownership</span><span class="tag">FHIR APIs</span><span class="tag">Regulatory compliance</span></div><details open><summary>Key contributions</summary><ul><li>Defined the product vision and roadmap for CMS-0057 Provider &amp; Payer Access APIs, prioritizing regulatory deadlines and business impact.</li><li>Led Agile ceremonies and translated HTI-4, CMS, Medicare, and Medicaid requirements into user stories and acceptance criteria.</li><li>Gathered partner requirements for a Developer Portal and an interoperability hub connecting 35+ BCBS plans.</li><li>Led requirements for a PDT data integration pipeline supporting compliant member enrollment data exchange.</li><li>Implemented an incident management framework using BMC Remedy and Azure DevOps, reducing resolution time by 30%.</li></ul></details></div></article>
<article class="role"><div class="role-meta"><time>Aug 2023 — Oct 2024</time></div><div><h3>UnitedHealth Group</h3><p class="role-title">Business Analyst</p><p class="role-description">Turned clinical and marketing requirements into analytics tools that made patient outcomes and operational performance easier to understand.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Tableau</span><span class="tag">Clinical analytics</span><span class="tag">Product ownership</span></div><details><summary>Key contributions</summary><ul><li>Prioritized analytics features by clinical impact and business value, collaborating with product stakeholders and development teams.</li><li>Applied statistical methods to patient data to identify care gaps and support treatment decisions.</li><li>Delivered dashboards adopted by 15+ clinical departments and monitored performance metrics to improve clinical workflows.</li></ul></details></div></article>
<article class="role"><div class="role-meta"><time>Jan 2023 — Dec 2023</time></div><div><h3>Centers Plan for Healthy Living</h3><p class="role-title">Business Analyst</p><p class="role-description">Made claims data more actionable, uncovering utilization patterns and cost drivers to support product decisions that reduced costs by 12%.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Claims analytics</span><span class="tag">SSIS / ETL</span><span class="tag">SSRS</span></div><details><summary>Key contributions</summary><ul><li>Developed SSIS data workflows that improved payer claims data quality and reduced processing time by 25%.</li><li>Designed SSRS reports to communicate claims and performance metrics to business stakeholders.</li><li>Mentored junior analysts in claims analysis, ETL processes, and report development.</li></ul></details></div></article>
<article class="role"><div class="role-meta"><time>Jun 2019 — Aug 2022</time></div><div><h3>Trigent Software Inc</h3><p class="role-title">Business Analyst</p><p class="role-description">Connected business and technical teams through clear requirements, Agile collaboration, and analysis that informed product enhancements.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Requirements analysis</span><span class="tag">Agile delivery</span><span class="tag">User acceptance testing</span></div><details><summary>Key contributions</summary><ul><li>Documented business requirements and user stories aligned with project objectives.</li><li>Facilitated Agile ceremonies and communication between business and technical teams.</li><li>Conducted data analysis and competitive benchmarking to inform product strategy.</li><li>Coordinated user acceptance test plans and collected feedback for actionable improvements.</li></ul></details></div></article>
